{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-hooks/tests/golden.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731497Z","id":"0f42bd1cd2cca299d666ce3c4e21272c5c0c28cecb36cef26bc50063e7d61648","body":{"detail":"It has failed intermittently under heavy machine load and passed on rerun. It sleeps 500 ms (line 353) before checking that no daemon.json appeared, a sleep standing in for a condition.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":323},"end":{"line":355},"content_hash":"2573300b44c6491eb8ce54344cfa5d91f738c9b5a3b7a020ad56c1956764d8fb"},"summary":"no_daemon_prints_nothing_and_starts_none is timing-sensitive under load","tags":["flaky-test","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-hooks/tests/golden.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731703Z","id":"e838ac28535976a94f74f4080f66078de3a196ef4d8847cce535a46ba5338a4b","body":{"detail":"On purpose: it shows a session-end hook gives up under Codex's 3 s cap and session-start keeps its longer budget. It asserts elapsed times (under 2900 ms; between 2900 and 4500 ms), wall-clock budgets in a functional test.","kind":"waiver","span":{"start":{"line":458},"end":{"line":495},"content_hash":"97086b91e92ae2e035566c87ba4eb558b9bdb517d1988521a9b6e068d550730e"},"summary":"session_end_gives_up_within_codexs_three_second_cap waits out real hook deadlines","tags":["gate-speed","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
