{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-hooks/tests/golden.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-30T08:56:12.092351Z","id":"a7f9a1c7293e90e3b9a30a14f1c730b6574f3472e773c69e460e0b11604f5c38","body":{"detail":"It has failed intermittently under heavy machine load and passed on rerun. It sleeps 500 ms (line 353) before checking that no daemon.json appeared, a sleep standing in for a condition.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":321},"end":{"line":353},"content_hash":"2573300b44c6491eb8ce54344cfa5d91f738c9b5a3b7a020ad56c1956764d8fb"},"summary":"no_daemon_prints_nothing_and_starts_none is timing-sensitive under load","supersedes":"bf350f6410527a0889ebdad22eb8b11f183aea221dff77bd59f5c379bbbc25bd","tags":["flaky-test","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347","session:claude-code:988152cb-8f78-4b12-acdd-a455490bed05"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-hooks/tests/golden.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-30T08:56:12.179130Z","id":"6164e2c883674d56fd67065ccc9aab55a0d9d40f164c616e43119118fe863d35","body":{"detail":"On purpose: it shows a session-end hook gives up under Codex's 3 s cap and session-start keeps its longer budget. It asserts elapsed times (under 2900 ms; between 2900 and 4500 ms), wall-clock budgets in a functional test.","kind":"waiver","span":{"start":{"line":456},"end":{"line":493},"content_hash":"97086b91e92ae2e035566c87ba4eb558b9bdb517d1988521a9b6e068d550730e"},"summary":"session_end_gives_up_within_codexs_three_second_cap waits out real hook deadlines","supersedes":"a87f08711b47e1f804896f7730e49a93d75e49e743c408238172980fb2c44b02","tags":["gate-speed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347","session:claude-code:988152cb-8f78-4b12-acdd-a455490bed05"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-hooks/tests/golden.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-30T23:36:18.271676Z","id":"dd6f4dd2a11c7dbefa9e935988614b9655730af430cbaf01fc58a6a06cca377a","body":{"detail":"session_end_gives_up_within_codexs_three_second_cap (crates/clax-hooks/tests/golden.rs) now reads the reason each run logged to hooks.log (a timeout of its own) instead of measuring elapsed time, and the budgets' fit to Codex's 3 s and Grok's 1.5 s caps is a unit test, end_hooks_give_up_inside_their_harnesses_caps (crates/clax-commands/src/commands/hook.rs). Injecting the deadlines into the binary would need a test-only setting in clax hook; not done. The waiver's remaining cost is the 2 s and 3 s request timeouts against the stalled daemon.","kind":"comment","references":"6164e2c883674d56fd67065ccc9aab55a0d9d40f164c616e43119118fe863d35","summary":"The wall-clock assertions are gone; the test still waits out the real request timeouts (about 5 s)","tags":["session:claude-code:988152cb-8f78-4b12-acdd-a455490bed05"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-hooks/tests/golden.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-30T23:36:18.558921Z","id":"57434cc80ad34411c7383e2f7005dde35fabc2fc26c898d6e5f2534393e21786","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:e7b8d160a","summary":"Fixed: the hook's deadline included the test thread's write of stdin (piped after spawn), so a run under load could log 'timed out' instead of 'no clax daemon is running'; hook_env now feeds stdin from a file, the 500 ms sleep is replaced by checking that no daemon.lock was taken, and Client::discover_local builds no HTTP client without a live daemon.json. bazelisk test //crates/clax-hooks:golden passes; the old test could not be made to fail here (40 runs under 54 busy loops on 18 cores passed), so the cause is by reading the only load-sensitive assertion","supersedes":"a7f9a1c7293e90e3b9a30a14f1c730b6574f3472e773c69e460e0b11604f5c38","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:988152cb-8f78-4b12-acdd-a455490bed05"]}}
